Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:11.99,OpeningQuote,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1775,0)}"Fortune favors the bold."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:11.99,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\pos(578,245)}Virgil, "Aeneid"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:16.37,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Quit spreading these \Nshitty rumors, Hashimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:20.79,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,We know you're the one spreading \Nthis crap on Sakayanagi's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.88,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Please, stop it, Ibuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.88,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.67,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let this stand, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.13,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,You really want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.32,Main,Mitaku,0,0,0,,Hey, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.53,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.51,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You back off! It's none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:37.83,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji got rumors spread about him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.11,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:42.40,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,A little crush on Karuizawa's \Nbarely anything, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:45.65,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I-It is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:48.50,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't like to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:52.24,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,but I suspect you, as well, Hashimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:53.66,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:57.54,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I'm the only witness to your secret \Nmeet-up with Karuizawa, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:59.04,Main,Sakura/Hasebe,0,0,0,,Meet-up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:01.29,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It was nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:04.54,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Don't ignore us, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.80,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Ishizaki-kun, please don't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.38,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.39,Main,Shiina,0,0,0,,Even if you get him to confess,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:13.05,Main,Shiina,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi-san will never admit to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.93,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,So we're just supposed \Nto lie down and take it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:19.41,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Could I ask you to forgive them for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.81,0:01:23.28,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Nothing to forgive. \NThere's no real harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:28.32,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,But I'd appreciate it if you'd \Nstop suspecting us for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.49,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,We don't need baseless \Naccusations in our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:33.56,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.71,0:01:35.95,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:53.34,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Ichinose-san finally came to school, did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:56.60,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Just in time for finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.58,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,What's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.35,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.35,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,You all did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.18,0:02:12.72,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,You got a 90, Kiyo-pon? That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:15.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You all did about as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:18.49,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:21.96,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Some people from Class A \Njust barged into Class B!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.01,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,What do you want, Sakayanagi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:37.76,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I've always had {\i1}such{\i0} respect \Nfor the teamwork of Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:39.42,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:43.95,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I've come here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:47.27,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Why don't you get to the point already?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:51.42,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You've entrusted all your private \Npoints to Ichinose-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:55.58,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,and backed by that savings, \Nyou've overcome many hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:57.66,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It's in regard to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:59.78,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:03.27,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with it, in and of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:11.20,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But what if it turns out that \Nthis accusation is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:15.42,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,What if Ichinose-san really is a criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:17.03,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,It's nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:20.50,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Just like the other rumors \Nyou've been spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:23.56,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm sure I have no idea \Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.51,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,What I'm holding is solid proof
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:30.69,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,that the rumors about Ichinose-san are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:32.44,Main,Students,0,0,0,,She's got proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.94,Main,Students,0,0,0,,What could it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:36.70,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,Calm down, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:40.82,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,To entrust the entire class's \Npoints to someone like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:43.19,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It just seems self-destructive, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:47.17,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Is anything I'm saying false,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:49.68,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Ichinose Honami-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:55.68,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Could you please let me through?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:56.82,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Ichinose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.23,0:03:58.72,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.54,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.15,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Be very quiet, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:18.49,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,She's attempting to show contrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:22.49,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:27.31,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to \Nhear what I have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.77,0:04:30.71,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi-san is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:33.50,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I have committed a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:37.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,An unforgivable crime.
