Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:42.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\p1\bord0.6\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(259.134,140.133)}m 0 0 l 16.5 0 l 16.5 16.5 l 0 16.5
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:42.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\p1\bord0.6\c&H5B00D4&\pos(276.534,140.133)}m 0 0 l 16.5 0 l 16.5 16.5 l 0 16.5
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:42.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\fs6.6\q2\fsp1.5\an3\fscx90\fnImpact\pos(284.934,114.633)}3rd Season
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:42.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\fs3.3\q2\fsp0\an7\pos(112.734,132.933)}Classroom{\fs3.6}\Nof\Nthe\NElite
