Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:42.01,sign_1521_9_Classroom_of_the,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2750,0)\c&H000000&\fscx60\fscy60\pos(208.134,140.133)}t{\c&HFFFFFF&}h{\c&H000000&}e {\c&HFFFFFF&}E{\c&H000000&}l{\c&HFFFFFF&}i{\c&H000000&}t{\c&HFFFFFF&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:45.01,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,295)\shad0\fnGeorgia\bord1\be1}Four Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.11,0:04:51.45,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I lived with just my mother \Nand my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:54.90,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It wasn't a life of luxury,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.29,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,but we had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:05.91,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Our mother worked very, \Nvery hard to provide for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.04,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,295)\shad0\fnGeorgia\bord1\be1}One Year Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:18.08,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,So I ran full tilt to earn scholarships \Nto get into high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:17.05,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&H000201&\bord0\shad0\an8\pos(320,65)}3rd-Year  Mock Exam  Extraordinary Scores
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:17.05,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&H000201&\bord0\shad0\an8\pos(320,180)}1st  Ichinose Honami\N 2nd  Tanaka Yusuke
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:21.28,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,even though I didn't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:30.88,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.32,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,In the summer of my third \Nyear of middle school...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.78,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,My mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:46.45,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:49.04,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HE1E2DE&\bord0\shad0\fs20\b1\frx4\fry352\fay-.13\pos(444,225.333)}Emergency Exit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:52.20,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It turned out that, in trying to buy \Na birthday present for my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.54,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,she took on more shifts \Nthan she could handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:06:00.60,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,My sister loved this one idol girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:04.74,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,And she had this one hair clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:12.03,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,My sister never talked about wanting \Nfashionable clothing or games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:17.75,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It was the first thing \Nshe'd ever said she wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:28.55,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Mom apologized over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:32.74,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry I couldn't give \Nyou a birthday present."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:36.50,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,So I made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.94,0:06:42.45,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I would buy that hair clip \Nfor my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:48.85,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I knew it was coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:54.25,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,but obviously, no one was willing to \Nhire a middle school student part-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.60,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,0)\3c&H292069&\shad0\bord4\fs18\pos(186,52)\c&HA1A6C5&\b1}Work Days
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.60,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H292069&\shad0\bord4\fs18\c&HA1A6C5&\b1\pos(186,106)}Days Off
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.60,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H292069&\shad0\bord4\fs18\c&HA1A6C5&\b1\pos(186,160)}Salary
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.60,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an7\c&H161C17&\bord0\shad0\pos(260,32)}2-5 per week
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.60,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an7\c&H161C17&\bord0\shad0\pos(260,86)}Days Off
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.60,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an7\c&H161C17&\bord0\shad0\pos(260,218.667)\fs16}General 1,200 yen\N High School 1,080 yen\N{\c&H16038F&}*Cannot hire middle school
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:07:00.98,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, I did everything \NI could to earn money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:03.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Except...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:09.83,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an8\c&HDFC4C1&\shad0}Last Chance to Buy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:19.69,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,Wow! Isn't it so cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:21.71,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,It's the one she wore in the magazine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.50,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,Yeah! I've wanted it so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:25.09,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.50,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey, let's come back tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:29.61,Flashback,Girl,0,0,0,,Yeah! We can't afford it today, \Nbut if we come back tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.85,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an8\c&HDFC4C1&\shad0}Last Chance to Buy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:43.19,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I wanted that hair clip so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.77,0:07:59.91,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Nobody saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:07.56,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I lied and said a friend lent me the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:13.85,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,My sister was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:18.26,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,She said, "Thanks, Big Sis!" so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:26.37,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,The sight of my sister's smile \Ntemporarily alleviated my guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.84,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,When my mother got out of the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:33.51,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,my sister and I went to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:40.02,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,My sister was so proud as she \Nshowed our mother the hair clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:44.85,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I couldn't bring myself to tell \Nher to keep it a secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.80,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,She was just so happy about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:58.77,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I think my mother knew I'd stolen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:01.24,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I couldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:08.61,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,She quickly took me back to the \Nstore to make me apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:13.88,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I was finally coming to terms \Nwith exactly what I'd done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:20.98,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,The minute we got home, my mother started \Ncrying, like a dam had burst inside her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:27.06,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'd never seen my mother \Ncry like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:35.28,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,In the end, the people from the store \Ndidn't turn me in to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:39.17,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I completely withdrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:42.87,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I spent six months rebuking myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:46.35,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I didn't leave my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:10.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.48,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,My mother told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:15.26,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H20201E&\bord0\shad0\pos(244,152)\frz335.9}Don't give up on high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.48,0:10:18.55,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,"Honami, don't give up on high school."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:23.91,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,"I want you to find your own happiness."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:42.23,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,So when I came here, \NI decided to try for a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:48.10,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,To restore my mother's and \Nsister's trust in me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.05,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:56.72,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I never told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:01.82,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I've been such an awful leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:04.60,Main,Shibata,0,0,0,,You're not, Ichinose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:08.14,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,We understand what you were going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:13.61,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,You shared your secret with us \Nnow because you trust us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:16.61,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:20.58,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make me laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:22.57,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:26.46,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,No matter the circumstances, \Nshoplifting is shoplifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:29.48,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,There's nothing to feel sympathy for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.84,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yes. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:37.47,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,The sins you've committed \Nnever fully go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:38.74,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Ichinose...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:42.68,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It's true. I shoplifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:45.91,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I don't intend to run away from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:50.83,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Because... I did do something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:54.48,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Such a brazen lack of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:55.97,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:12:00.38,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Perhaps all my hard work came \Nfrom a place of pretend virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:06.40,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But... I want to graduate with \Nall of you. In this class!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:09.50,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I want to walk alongside all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:13.03,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Despite all my failings, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:16.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Will you come to the very end with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:17.26,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Of course we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:19.51,Main,Shibata,0,0,0,,We'll come along with her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.57,Main,Class B,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:20.91,Main,Class B,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:22.64,Main,Class B,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.98,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:31.41,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:36.15,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.97,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:40.16,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Isn't this a happy little resolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:44.83,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But the truth remains that \Nyou committed a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:47.74,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The story's going to continue to spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:49.92,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm prepared for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.55,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:54.01,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Then I'll do—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:56.29,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:59.47,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The student council president \Nand the teachers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:04.43,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,The spreading of malicious \Nrumors is hereby forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:10.44,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Did Ichinose-san report the \Ntrouble she was having?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:14.97,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,This problem has gone far \Nbeyond just Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.97,0:13:17.08,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,We've been made aware of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:20.82,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,the hurtful comments being \Nperpetuated among you first-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:25.60,Main,Hoshinomiya,0,0,0,,Any further spreading of rumors would \Nbreach the school's code of morality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:32.08,Main,Hoshinomiya,0,0,0,,Any person found spreading malicious \Nrumors will henceforth be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.99,0:13:35.23,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:39.64,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,If the school's gotten involved, \Nthen my business here is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:42.09,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'll be taking my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:57.76,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Splendidly done, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.66,0:14:00.63,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Could you tell me one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:07.24,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Did Ichinose-san confess her \Npast to you before today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:08.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:15.92,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I visited Ichinose's room yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:23.37,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Hey... could I ask you a strange question?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:25.04,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:29.95,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Why don't you say anything to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:34.68,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The reason I come here every day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:38.14,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,is because I'm waiting for you to confess...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:40.66,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:44.92,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Waiting for me... to confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:50.61,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I know what crime it is you're guilty of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:53.62,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.57,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What you did won't vanish \Nbecause you ran from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:14:58.76,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:03.90,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I... I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:06.62,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I know I did a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:11.25,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I really thought I didn't have a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:16.60,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I wanted to make my sister smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:19.78,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I was so thoughtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:21.48,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I was so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:23.81,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Running was all I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:25.62,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,And now, again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:34.16,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,And now, just like then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:36.27,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I've completely withdrawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.37,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What should I have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.59,0:15:43.25,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:44.59,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:48.32,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Tell me, Ayanokoji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:53.95,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to leave this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:55.60,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.64,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I think you'll just have to face it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:00.55,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:10.18,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Ichinose's heart was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:13.23,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:21.16,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm the one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.17,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,who shattered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:31.56,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Then the broken part healed \Nback stronger than before,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:33.81,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,allowing her to rebuke your accusation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:36.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:38.56,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,How very moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.05,0:16:42.35,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You used Kamuro to bring \Nme into this, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:44.82,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:51.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The can of beer she gave me is the one \Nshe stole early in the school year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:54.64,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The "best by" date on the can she gave me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:59.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,was almost a year before \Nthe ones currently on sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:06.61,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Which means that beer came \Nfrom you, Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:13.00,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd initially intended to simply \Nwait and watch what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:17.11,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But you used Kamuro to drag me into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:18.22,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:22.40,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I did it all to get you interested in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:27.72,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,So you don't care about Ichinose at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:29.36,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:33.08,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Why don't we have a competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:35.74,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't see what I have to gain by agreeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:41.00,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,What if I put my own expulsion on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:47.50,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Obviously, even if I lose, \Nyou won't need to quit school yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:49.76,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:55.25,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,If you lose, I will reveal to everyone \Nthat you're the mastermind behind Class C.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:58.01,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What are we wagering on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:18:00.61,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,How about the upcoming exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:06.65,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It seems my school life is \Nfinally about to get exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:17.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Thank you for the chocolate you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:23.67,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I didn't call you here to \Ntalk about that, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:30.46,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The information Kushida gave me \Nbefore Valentine's was on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:37.42,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Vice President Kiriyama, I want you to post \Nthis information on the message boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:39.93,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,To save Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:44.31,Flashback,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,If this comes out, trust among \Nthe student body will plummet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:49.30,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The person who will be hurt the \Nmost by that is President Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:52.69,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be to your benefit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:55.68,Flashback,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,And I'll be the one punished for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:58.49,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you refuse to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:02.77,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll have to report to the former president
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:06.39,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,that you've already fallen \Nin line with Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:08.12,Flashback,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:12.05,Flashback,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,You owe me a big favor, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:15.45,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.13,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I'm just happy to be of service!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:20.18,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,So, you know what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:20.98,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:22.82,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs10\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HAD8B75&\frz26.4\pos(266,54.667)}Points will be transferred.\N Accept?\N Cancel  Confirm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:24.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I just sent you your informant's fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.48,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs10\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HAD8B75&\frz26.4\c&HFFFA81&\pos(276,94.667)}Point Transfer in Progress
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:26.34,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Go on and check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:30.48,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Looks great to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:34.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be giving you \Nhalf of any points that I earn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:36.52,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Is that acceptable?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:38.60,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:43.79,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,As long as you keep paying me, \NI'll let bygones be bygones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:45.96,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,You're so smart, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:48.75,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,You're not at all like Horikita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.56,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Can we continue to get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.55,0:19:55.09,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Rising to Sakayanagi's challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:59.26,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,and saving Ichinose were purely incidental.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:04.07,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I wanted \Nto learn via this incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:09.04,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The quality and quantity of the \Ninformation Kushida Kikyo possesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.07,0:20:11.68,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,To confirm that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:15.59,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,and to compel her expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:51.76,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Morning, Ayanokoji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:53.32,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:55.54,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You were pretty cool yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:22:00.03,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.03,0:22:03.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's impressive to put your old \Ndemons to rest with your own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:05.91,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.74,0:22:09.38,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I can't take back what I did back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:10.60,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:13.81,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I think I can live with it from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.51,0:22:18.60,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you ever run the risk of \Nlosing sight of yourself again,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.22,0:22:21.57,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,feel free to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:28.46,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm always capable of listening, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:33.26,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You'd let me rely on you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:35.43,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you're willing to, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.12,0:22:40.20,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:42.82,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:45.14,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.69,0:22:47.56,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Well, see...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:50.98,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Oh, th-that's funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:53.48,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I thought it would come out more smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.48,0:22:56.11,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.11,0:22:59.84,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I've never given anyone \Nsomething like this before...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:03.00,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure how else to \Nshow my appreciation, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:05.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You don't have to force it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.41,0:23:07.87,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I-I-I-I'm not forcing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.05,0:23:15.87,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It's a bit late... but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.87,0:23:17.24,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Valentine's Day chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.47,0:23:20.69,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Y-You don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.01,0:23:24.05,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:26.00,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Thank you.
